        </span>
        <span class="card-copy">
          <span class="label">E-mail</span>
          <span class="value">Sergio.rib@live.com</span>
          <span class="detail">Vamos trocar uma ideia</span>
        </span>
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>

      <a class="contact-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sergio-ribeiro-cerqueira" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
